        "is_free": true,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Ghost Code: Escape&quot; is the humble beginnings of a new saga. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a relatively simple 2D platformer. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Breezy Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most of the 18 stages can be completed in under 30 seconds, but mastering them can be a challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Art</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game doesn't use tiled environments. Every stage is handcrafted as a singular art piece.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Peek into a New World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story isn't front and center, but it is an origin of sorts for a big player in the world of Ghost Code.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It's 100% free, so give it a try.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Ghost Code: Escape&quot; is the humble beginnings of a new saga. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a relatively simple 2D platformer. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Breezy Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most of the 18 stages can be completed in under 30 seconds, but mastering them can be a challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Art</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game doesn't use tiled environments. Every stage is handcrafted as a singular art piece.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Peek into a New World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story isn't front and center, but it is an origin of sorts for a big player in the world of Ghost Code.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It's 100% free, so give it a try.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Collect pets and explore 18 handcrafted levels as you uncover a small part of the world of Ghost Code.",
